            {
                "version": "0.304.0_2024.9.13.5.13.1.548",
                "change_log": "0.304.0\n\n**fixes**:\n-[North Korea is listed as Nepal in the Flag Selection screen. #469](https://github.com/ForFunLabs/ElevenPublicBugsAndAsks/issues/469)\n-[Some country names are missing from the country list. #478](https://github.com/ForFunLabs/ElevenPublicBugsAndAsks/issues/478)\n-[world flag not selectable in list after tutorial #492](https://github.com/ForFunLabs/ElevenPublicBugsAndAsks/issues/492)\n-[log sending will stop even when forced #494](https://github.com/ForFunLabs/ElevenPublicBugsAndAsks/issues/494)\n-[floor indicator on portal is larger than other envs #500](https://github.com/ForFunLabs/ElevenPublicBugsAndAsks/issues/500)\n-[portal will not load correctly sometimes #502](https://github.com/ForFunLabs/ElevenPublicBugsAndAsks/issues/502)\n-[avatar images not shown in left panel #503](https://github.com/ForFunLabs/ElevenPublicBugsAndAsks/issues/503)\n-removed unusable spectator mode option from pico graphics settings\n\n\n**updates**\n-[add ball speed info in wall mode #495](https://github.com/ForFunLabs/ElevenPublicBugsAndAsks/issues/495)\n-Pico4 Ultra Controllers Added\n-Vivox disabled\n-continuing to work on replays:\n\tAs we know many of you would want to share replays with others, or post them on your social media, we are working on a way for the headset itself to provide .mp4 files\n\tAdditionally we are working on the UI for controlling the replays both with controllers and with the menu \n"
